---
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<title>Tungsten — a local-first notes app</title>
		<style>
			:root {
				--bg: #1e1e1e;
				--bg-card: #262626;
				--text: #dcddde;
				--text-muted: #9a9a9a;
				--border: #2e2e2e;
				--accent: #9b7df5;
			}
			@media (prefers-color-scheme: light) {
				:root {
					--bg: #ffffff;
					--bg-card: #f5f5f5;
					--text: #2e2e2e;
					--text-muted: #6b6b6b;
					--border: #e0e0e0;
					--accent: #7c3aed;
				}
			}
			* {
				box-sizing: border-box;
			}
			body {
				margin: 0;
				background: var(--bg);
				color: var(--text);
				font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
			}
			main {
				max-width: 720px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				padding: 80px 24px 60px;
				text-align: center;
			}
			h1 {
				font-size: 2.6rem;
				margin: 0 0 8px;
			}
			p.tagline {
				font-size: 1.15rem;
				color: var(--text-muted);
				margin: 0 0 32px;
			}
			.cta {
				display: flex;
				gap: 12px;
				justify-content: center;
				margin-bottom: 64px;
			}
			.cta a {
				padding: 10px 22px;
				border-radius: 8px;
				text-decoration: none;
				font-weight: 600;
				font-size: 0.95rem;
			}
			.cta a.primary {
				background: var(--accent);
				color: #fff;
			}
			.cta a.secondary {
				border: 1px solid var(--border);
				color: var(--text);
			}
			.features {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
				gap: 16px;
				text-align: left;
			}
			.features div {
				background: var(--bg-card);
				border: 1px solid var(--border);
				border-radius: 10px;
				padding: 18px 20px;
			}
			.features h3 {
				margin: 0 0 6px;
				font-size: 1rem;
			}
			.features p {
				margin: 0;
				color: var(--text-muted);
				font-size: 0.9rem;
			}
			@media (max-width: 560px) {
				.features {
					grid-template-columns: 1fr;
				}
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<main>
			<h1>Tungsten</h1>
			<p class="tagline">
				A local-first notes app. Your vault is a plain folder on disk — no
				account, no server, no lock-in.
			</p>
			<div class="cta">
				<a class="primary" href="/docs/install/">Install</a>
				<a class="secondary" href="/docs/introduction/">Read the docs</a>
			</div>
			<div class="features">
				<div>
					<h3>Plain files</h3>
					<p>Notes are Markdown, folders are folders. Readable with or without the app.</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3>Environments & Categories</h3>
					<p>Organize vaults-within-a-vault with a color-coded icon rail.</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3>Built on Tauri</h3>
					<p>Native webview and a Rust backend — no bundled browser runtime.</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3>Yours to customize</h3>
					<p>Light, dark, or system theme, an accent color, and custom CSS per vault.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>
